                "fontSize": "custom",
                "markdown": "### Import Data into Splunk via Splunk Web\n\n- Go to **Settings** → **Data Inputs** → **File & Directories** → **New Local File & Directory** →\nBrowse & Select ’**dns events.json’** → Select **’Index Once’** → Click **Next**\n\n- Select  **’synthetic-data’** from Source type list → **App Context: ’Search & Reporting (search)’**\n→ Host field value: **’dns-guard-simulator’** → Create a new index → Index name: **’synthetic-\ndata’** (Important!); leave the other fields as they are. → Click **Save** → Click **Review** → Click **Submit**"
            },
            "type": "splunk.markdown"
        },
